OL,3,GNEWSAMansion's lost Victorian
OL,4,Aflowerbeds to be restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FIntricate flowerbeds designed more than
OL,7,F150 years ago at a grand Victorian
OL,8,Fmansion are being recreated.
OL,10,FWitley Court in Worcestershire was once
OL,11,Fpart of the aristocratic social scene
OL,12,Fof the late 1800s and known for hosting
OL,13,Fglittering balls, according to English
OL,14,FHeritage.
OL,16,FIts gardens, designed by one of
OL,17,FVictorian Britain's foremost landscape
OL,18,Fdesigners, are being restored by the
OL,19,Fcharity, which is hoping to reinstate
OL,20,Fthe embroidery-like flowerbeds around
OL,21,Fthe site's Perseus and Andromeda
OL,22,Ffountain.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
